§ `ss 9 and 36`

#ASSERT NOT `the clause is a pay when paid provision` `the subcontractor waives adjudication`

#ASSERT `the clause is struck down by the Act` `pay the subcontractor only when the employer pays the main contractor`
#ASSERT `the clause is struck down by the Act` `payment conditional on the employer's financing agreement`
#ASSERT `the clause is struck down by the Act` `the subcontractor waives adjudication`
#ASSERT `the clause is struck down by the Act` `the subcontractor forfeits its retention if it adjudicates`
#ASSERT NOT `the clause is struck down by the Act` `payment within 30 days of the claim`
#ASSERT NOT `the clause is struck down by the Act` `liquidated damages for late completion`

